UI v8 (Nuxt UI) frontend go-live checklist
For manual verification, flag on (NUXT_UI_ENABLED=true), `npm run dev`.
Check each section in BOTH light and dark mode unless noted.
"Renders" = no blank page, no console error, layout/spacing/icons match the old v7 app.


=== 1. Navigation shell ===
- [ ] LeftMenu opens/closes (OpenLeftMenu button), all links navigate to the right route
- [ ] LeftMenu highlights the active route correctly
- [ ] Breadcrumb (LycheeBreadcrumb) shows correct path and each crumb is clickable
- [ ] GoBack / BackLinkButton returns to the expected previous view (not just router.back() into a broken state)
- [ ] GalleryFooter and LandingFooter render with correct links
- [ ] AlbumsHeader / AlbumHeader / PhotoHeader / SearchHeader / TimelineHeader all show correct
      title, action buttons, and those buttons are wired (not dead)


=== 2. Gallery browsing (Home, Albums, Album, Photo) ===
- [ ] /home renders top-level albums/photos correctly
- [ ] /gallery list view (AlbumListView / AlbumListItem) and thumb view (AlbumThumbPanel /
      AlbumThumbPanelList) both render and can be toggled
- [ ] Opening an album (/gallery/:albumId): AlbumHero / AlbumHeaderImage / AlbumHeaderPanel
      render; sub-albums (AlbumPanel) and photos (PhotoThumbPanel / PhotoThumbPanelList) both show
- [ ] AlbumPeopleFilter and AlbumTagFilter filter the visible photos correctly
- [ ] AlbumStatistics drawer opens with correct counts
- [ ] Photo click opens PhotoBox / PhotoPanel (lightbox) with NextPrevious navigation working
      (arrow keys + on-screen buttons), Dock/DockButton actions all present and functional
- [ ] PhotoBox media-type matrix — each ImageViewMode renders correctly, not just plain images:
      - [ ] Video file: HTML5 `<video>` player loads and plays (ImageViewMode.Video)
      - [ ] Live Photo: still shows first, hover/press plays the motion clip
            (LivePhotoMedium / LivePhotoOriginal), `data-video-src` (live_photo_url) resolves
      - [ ] RAW file: fallback preview renders, no broken image icon (ImageViewMode.Raw)
      - [ ] PDF file: renders inline or via correct viewer (ImageViewMode.Pdf)
      - [ ] Oversized/original image (ImageViewMode.Original vs Medium) loads the right resolution
- [ ] PhotoRatingWidget / PhotoRatingOverlay: set/change a star rating, persists on reload
- [ ] ColourSquare (dominant color) displays
- [ ] FaceOverlay draws correctly over a photo with detected faces
- [ ] NsfwDetectionOverlay shows the NSFW warning/blur where expected (SensitiveWarning too, at
      album level); confirm blur actually hides content until explicitly revealed
- [ ] MapInclude (photo location mini-map) and LinksInclude render on photo detail
- [ ] HeaderFocusPicker / HeaderEditButton (album header image picker/edit) works
- [ ] Favourites (/gallery/favourites): add/remove a photo from favourites, list updates
- [ ] Pagination — both modes, for both albums and photos (LycheeState
      albums_infinite_scroll_threshold / photos_infinite_scroll_threshold config):
      - [ ] Infinite-scroll mode: PaginationInfiniteScroll's IntersectionObserver fires once per
            threshold crossing (not double-fired), loading spinner shows, stops requesting once
            hasMore is false
      - [ ] Load-more mode: PaginationLoadMore button shows loading state while fetching, label
            updates, button disappears/disables when no more pages
- [ ] Empty states: an album with zero photos, zero sub-albums, and a fresh account with zero
      albums all show a sane empty message (not a blank panel or spinner stuck forever)
- [ ] Album that contains only sub-albums (no direct photos) — Map button/entry still reachable
- [ ] Flow view (/flow, /flow/:albumId/:photoId): AlbumCard, CarouselImages, LigtBox (lightbox),
      TopImages, HeaderImage, Blur all render and lightbox opens/closes correctly
- [ ] Frame view (/frame/:albumId) renders slideshow-style correctly
- [ ] Timeline (/timeline, /timeline/:date/:photoId): TimelineDates scrubber jumps to correct date
- [ ] Tag view (/tag/:tagId/:photoId): TagPanel lists correct photos
- [ ] Map view (/map, /map/:albumId): pins render, clicking a pin opens the right photo
- [ ] Search (/search, /search/:albumId/:photoId): SearchPanel input returns results in
      ResultPanel; scoped-to-album vs global search both work


=== 3. Album & photo actions (dialogs) ===
Trigger each from its real entry point (context menu / action button), not just by inspecting code.
- [ ] AlbumCreateDialog — create a new album, appears in the tree
- [ ] AlbumCreatePersonDialog — create a person from an album context
- [ ] AlbumCreateShareDialog / AlbumShare / ShareLine — create a share link, copy link works
- [ ] AlbumCreateTagDialog — create/attach a tag
- [ ] AlbumDelete — delete confirmation works, cancel doesn't delete, confirm actually deletes;
      also test deleting an album that still has sub-albums/photos inside it
- [ ] AlbumMove — move an album into another, tree updates; test moving into a descendant is
      correctly blocked/disabled (no circular tree)
- [ ] AlbumProperties — edit title/description/dates, saves and reflects immediately
- [ ] AlbumPurchasable — attach/detach a purchasable price list
- [ ] AlbumTransfer — transfer ownership to another user; test this dialog's visibility is
      correctly gated (owner/admin only — should not appear for a regular viewer)
- [ ] AlbumVisibility — toggle public/private/password, setting sticks; test the password
      variant specifically (set password, log out, confirm Unlock is required, wrong password
      rejected, correct password grants access)
- [ ] ApplyRenamerDialog — apply a renamer rule, filenames update
- [ ] ConfirmSharingDialog — confirmation copy/behavior correct before sharing
- [ ] EmbedCodeDialog — generated embed snippet is correct and copyable
- [ ] SearchTargetAlbum / SearchTargetUser (share-target pickers) — search & select works
- [ ] SelectDrag — drag-select multiple photos in an album, bulk action bar appears
- [ ] Unlock — password-protected album prompts and unlocks correctly
- [ ] WatermarkConfirmDialog — shows before applying a watermark, cancel/confirm both correct
- [ ] AlbumEdit / PhotoEdit drawers — open, edit fields, save, drawer closes and reflects changes
- [ ] PhotoDetails drawer — all metadata fields populated correctly (EXIF, size, etc.)
- [ ] PhotoCopyDialog — copy a photo to another album
- [ ] PhotoLicenseDialog — change photo license, persists
- [ ] PhotoTagDialog — add/remove tags on a single photo
- [ ] DownloadAlbum / DownloadPhoto modals — download options correct, actual download triggers


=== 4. Upload ===
- [ ] UploadPanel modal opens from the upload button
- [ ] Drag-and-drop file(s) onto the drop zone triggers upload (DropBoxChooser)
- [ ] UploadingLine shows per-file progress, error state on a bad file (wrong type / too large)
- [ ] ImportFromLink — import via URL works
- [ ] ImportFromServer — import from server path works (if enabled for this instance)
- [ ] CameraCapture — capture-from-camera modal opens and captures (if device has a camera)
- [ ] Multiple simultaneous uploads don't visually clash or drop progress rows
- [ ] Upload edge cases: duplicate filename already in the album (skip/overwrite/rename prompt),
      zero-byte/corrupt file, network interruption mid-upload (retry or clear error, not a
      silently-stuck progress bar)
- [ ] Uploading a video and a Live Photo pair both process correctly and later render right in
      section 2's media-type matrix


=== 5. Face recognition & People ===
- [ ] /people list renders, search/filter works
- [ ] /people/:personId/:photoId detail page shows correct faces/photos for that person
- [ ] PersonCard renders correctly in list/grid
- [ ] /people/clusters (FaceClusters): cluster grid renders sample crops correctly
- [ ] BatchFaceAssignmentModal — assign multiple faces to a person/new person at once
- [ ] MergePersonModal — merge two people, face counts combine correctly
- [ ] PersonDeleteDialog — delete confirmation, cancel vs confirm both correct
- [ ] Cluster detail dialog — paginated face grid loads more on scroll, dismiss single face works
- [ ] Assign / Dismiss buttons on a cluster row show loading state and update the list after


=== 6. Sharing & Tags management ===
- [ ] /sharing page: BulkSharingModal bulk-create/edit works, ShareLine rows show correct info
- [ ] Revoke a share link, it stops working / disappears from the list
- [ ] /tags (TagsManagement): create, rename, delete a tag
- [ ] Bulk album edit (/bulk-album-edit): multi-select rows, apply a field change to all
      selected (visibility, NSFW flag, etc.), confirm change actually applied


=== 7. Admin & Settings ===
- [ ] /admin dashboard: widgets/stats render (AdminDashboard)
- [ ] /admin/settings/:tab — walk EVERY settings category tab, each one its own checklist row:
      - [ ] Admin
      - [ ] config
      - [ ] Footer
      - [ ] Gallery
      - [ ] Image Processing
      - [ ] lychee SE
      - [ ] Mod Back Button
      - [ ] Mod Cache
      - [ ] Mod Flow
      - [ ] Mod Frame
      - [ ] Mod Map
      - [ ] Mod NSFW
      - [ ] Mod Privacy
      - [ ] Mod Pro
      - [ ] Mod RSS
      - [ ] Mod Search
      - [ ] Mod Timeline
      - [ ] Mod Welcome
      - [ ] Smart Albums
      - [ ] Symbolic Link
      - [ ] Users Management
      - [ ] special "CssJs" tab (raw CSS/JS editor — syntax highlighting, save works)
      - [ ] special "all" tab (every category rendered on one page, no layout collision between
            categories, still scrolls/saves correctly)
- [ ] Every field type inside a category tab: toggle/boolean, text input, number input, select
      dropdown, and secret/password-masked field (is_secret) all render and save correctly
- [ ] Change a setting value, save, reload page, value persisted
- [ ] /admin/users: CreateEditUser — create a user, edit a user, ListUser shows updated list
- [ ] /admin/user-groups: create/edit a group, assign a user to it
- [ ] /admin/jobs: job list renders, statuses correct, can trigger/cancel a job if applicable
- [ ] /admin/maintenance and /admin/maintenance/faces: maintenance actions run and report result
- [ ] /admin/nsfw-config: toggle NSFW detection settings, saves
- [ ] /admin/contact-messages: list renders, opening a message shows full content
- [ ] /admin/webhooks: create/edit/delete a webhook, test-trigger if available
- [ ] /admin/moderation: moderation queue renders, approve/reject actions work
- [ ] /admin/purchasables and /admin/shop/sizes (PrintPixelSizesAdmin): create/edit a
      purchasable and a print size, both save correctly
- [ ] /fixTree: tree-fix diff view renders, applying a fix works
- [ ] /duplicatesFinder: duplicate groups render, resolving a duplicate works
- [ ] /diagnostics: diagnostic checks run and report pass/fail correctly
- [ ] /permissions: permission matrix renders and toggles save
- [ ] /renamerRules: create/edit/delete a renamer rule


=== 8. Webshop / checkout ===
- [ ] /basket: add/remove items, quantity updates, totals recalculate
- [ ] /checkout/:step stepper (UStepper) — step "info" -> "payment" -> "completed" all render
      and the stepper indicator updates correctly
- [ ] Offline payment path (is_offline) shows the correct alternate step 2/3 flow
      (useStepOffline / markAsOffline) — order is created and marked pending, no PayPal UI shown
- [ ] Online payment path (PayPal, usePaypal.ts): isStepTwoValid gating actually blocks submit
      until valid; the `#paypal-button-container` renders real PayPal buttons (client ID/currency
      loaded from options); a completed sandbox/test payment moves to the "completed" step and
      creates a transaction record
- [ ] PayPal script failure (missing/invalid paypal_client_id) is handled gracefully, not a
      blank container or unhandled console error
- [ ] Navigating back a step (router push to "info") preserves entered data
- [ ] /orders list renders; /order/:orderId/:transactionId shows correct order detail
- [ ] OrderDownload: download link/content-url fields save correctly per item
- [ ] /admin/purchasables list reflected correctly in the storefront


=== 9. Auth & account ===
- [ ] /login — LoginModal / LoginPage: correct credentials succeed, wrong credentials show error
- [ ] /register — RegisterLychee / RegisterPage: new account flow completes
- [ ] WebauthnModal — passkey/WebAuthn registration and login (if configured)
- [ ] InviteUser modal — invite flow sends/creates correctly
- [ ] /profile: edit profile fields, change password, save
- [ ] SessionExpiredReload modal appears on session expiry and reload button works


=== 10. Misc modals ===
- [ ] AboutLychee — version/info correct
- [ ] KeybindingsHelp — shortcut list renders and matches actual bound keys
- [ ] SecurityAdvisoriesModal — renders correctly when triggered


=== 11. Cross-cutting UI mechanics ===
- [ ] Toasts (useAppToast) show/dismiss correctly for both success and error cases, stack
      properly when multiple fire close together
- [ ] Confirm dialogs (useConfirmDialog) block/resolve correctly, cancel truly cancels
- [ ] Modals (UModal) — no double scrollbar, backdrop click dismisses, ESC closes
- [ ] Tab-key focus trapping works inside every modal opened above
- [ ] Tooltips show on hover everywhere they used to in v7
- [ ] All icons render (no missing-glyph boxes) across every page visited above
- [ ] No PrimeVue-looking artifacts (ripple effect, old focus rings, mismatched fonts) anywhere
- [ ] Light/dark toggle works and persists across navigation and full page reload
- [ ] Responsive/mobile layout check specifically on: gallery/album view, photo lightbox,
      admin settings, bulk album edit, checkout
- [ ] Keyboard-only pass: can reach and operate every primary action (open album, open photo,
      next/prev, upload, save a dialog) using only Tab/Enter/Space/Esc/arrow keys
- [ ] Screen-reader spot check on one flow (e.g. login, or album creation) — form fields have
      labels, modal announces its title on open


=== 12. Role/permission matrix ===
Repeat a sample of section 2/3/7 with each role, since UI is often only tested as admin:
- [ ] Guest / not-logged-in: only public albums visible, no edit affordances rendered at all
      (not just disabled buttons)
- [ ] Regular logged-in user (non-admin): sees own albums + shared-with-them albums; admin-only
      dialogs (AlbumTransfer, admin nav items, /admin/* routes) are absent, not just blocked
- [ ] Admin: full access confirmed across section 7


=== 13. Tooling sanity (frontend only) ===
- [ ] `npm run check` passes with no type errors
- [ ] `npm run build` succeeds
- [ ] `npm run format` clean
- [ ] No leftover TODO/FIXME in resources/js/v8 that blocks a real feature
